{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"带状范畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"带状范畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>带状范畴 (ribbon category) 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"ReshetikhinTuraevRibbon","text":"Reshetikhin–Turaev"}},{"Plain":" 基于"},{"Local":{"url":"辫幺半范畴","text":"辫幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":"引入的结构, 使得其"},{"Local":{"url":"线图","text":"线图"}},{"Plain":"可以画成有宽度的丝带状 (标架缠结), 丝带可以扭.</p>\n<p>辫幺半范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"线图","text":"线图"}},{"Plain":"是三维空间中的一维"},{"Local":{"url":"缠结","text":"缠结"}},{"Plain":", 而丝带则是缠结上带有法丛的平凡化, 也即标架缠结. 丝带的扭即是沿着一维流形走的过程中标架旋转一圈.</p>\n<img src=\"/assets/ribbon-twist.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" style=\"display:block; margin:auto;\">\n<p>带状范畴是 $\\mathsf{Cat}$ 中标架 $2$-圆盘算畴的代数.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>带状范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"辫幺半范畴","text":"辫幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $(\\mathcal C,\\beta)$ 带有自然变换 $\\theta\\colon \\mathrm{id} \\to \\mathrm{id}$ (称为<strong>扭</strong>) 以及左右"},{"Local":{"url":"对偶(范畴论)","text":"对偶"}},{"Plain":", 满足</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\theta_{X\\otimes Y} = \\beta_{Y,X}\\beta_{X,Y}(\\theta_X\\otimes\\theta_Y).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}